id: focus-genes-of-a-parasite
name: Genes of a Parasite
order: 2
optionOf: genetic-focus-neo-tuffle
optionEffect: 6
# Neo-Tuffle Genes' Option chosen: this one.
follows: genes-of-a-parasite
description: >
  You gain access to the Liquid Form Maneuver (see — Special Maneuvers). While in Liquid Form, you have access to the Possess Maneuver (see — Special Maneuvers).
text: >
  Genes of a Parasite [Passive]: You gain access to the Liquid Form Maneuver (see — Special Maneuvers). While in Liquid Form, you have access to the Possess Maneuver (see — Special Maneuvers).

---

# The Liquid Form Special Maneuver. The Possess Maneuver waits, with Possession, for the Transformations (its text saved).
[passive]
allow maneuver.liquid-form;
